Z||000003||WampusCat||12-28-2001||02:36 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.hifi.com" TARGET=_blank>www.hifi.com</A>  has their basecube 8 on sale for $180.  It's regularly $250.  I know that's way over $100, but it got great reviews from everybody.  Their model 88 table radio(no CD player) is $150 and I think it sounds better than the Bose Wave.  It is bigger than the wave though.||||reg||1
Z||000004||falconhulk||12-28-2001||02:50 PM||||If you look hard, you can find discontinued powered 50 watt woofers for less then 75 bucks.  ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Master_Sushi||12-28-2001||08:13 PM||||Maybe get a cheap computer speaker system sub woffer. I also think those bose wave radios are rip offs. My 40$ computer speaker set sounds better then it.||||reg||1
